	(descr "Bosch Sensortec BMI270 LGA-14 3.0 x 2.5. Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/BMI270.pdf (BST-BMI270-DS000-08) p145 s8.3 'Landing pattern recommendation': side pads 0.475 x 0.25 at 0.5 pitch, inner edge 0.925 from the centre; end pads 0.25 x 0.475, inner edge 0.675; body 3.0 x 2.5; pin 1 top-left. side pad centres x +-(0.925 + 0.2375) = +-1.1625, end pad centres y +-(0.675 + 0.2375) = +-0.9125. Spec in the Bosch top view, frame_rot 180 into the OpenDrone '-BR' frame (pin 1 lower right, as built on OpenFC-Lite-Mini); 3D model turned 180 deg to follow pin 1. Lands inside the body (budget LGA14 2.6 x 3.1 = body + 0.1). Corrected copy of OpenDrone:LGA-14_L3.0-W2.5-P0.50-BR (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/LGA-14_L3.0-W2.5-P0.50-BR_W.json")
